<title>USA: Yamanouchi Shaklee unit to build plant.</title>
<headline>Yamanouchi Shaklee unit to build plant.</headline>
<dateline>NORMAN, Okla. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shaklee Corp, a unit of Yamanouchi Pharmaceutical Co Ltd, said it will break ground in early 1997 for a $23.5 million solid dosage pharmaceutical manufacturing facility in Norman, Oklahoma.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to complete the 58,482 sq.-ft. pharmaceutical manufacturing facility, which will include three production lines for solid dosage pharmaceutical manufacturing, in about 20 months.</p>
